      "message": "It would be nice to include an optional lambda to CreateTestKeys that takes a reference to the AuthorizationSetBuilder as an input parameter.\n\nThen we can call the lambda on each builder to alter it. This way, we could call `AttestationChallenge` and `AttestationApplicationid` for all the same kinds of keys we test in the various other functions.\n\nCreateTestKeys(TAG_EARLY_BOOT_ONLY, ErrorCode::Ok,\n  [](AuthorizationSetBuilder\u0026 builder) {\n    builder\n      .AttestationChallenge(\"challenge\")\n      .AttestationApplicationId(\"app_id\");\n  });\n\nThat said, this is probably fine as is. Your call if you want to make it \"fancy\".",
